From 2a8b2b45288b2a45bc99784fd19bf99d218d4093 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: autarkis <autarkis@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 13:58:49 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] trace: concatenated-stream trace hook with ZIP64 flush

Stream<T> buffers concatenate all clips' data into contiguous arrays
with int64 offset tables. Single ZIP64 npz flush at end_decomposition.

Fixes: thread-unsafe buffer ops outside mutex, uint16 entry overflow
at >65535 entries, ftell 32-bit overflow on >2GB files.
h_shape (20954 clips) produces ~20 npz entries instead of 167k.
